OL,3,GNEWSACity e-scooter trial could begin
OL,4,Ain summer 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Manchester could be
OL,7,Ftravelling around on a fleet of
OL,8,Felectric scooters next year after plans
OL,9,Ffor a new trial were announced.
OL,11,FManchester City Council is putting
OL,12,Ftogether proposals for the scheme and
OL,13,Fsaid in a report that it could begin in
OL,14,Fsummer 2027, although the authority
OL,15,Fadded it had not yet considered an
OL,16,Foperator for the e-scooters.
OL,18,FThe plans come off the back of the Lime
OL,19,Fscooter scheme in Salford which Salford
OL,20,FCouncil said had been a major success.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
