OL,3,GNEWSACity e-scooter trial could begin
OL,4,Ain summer 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council spokesperson stressed that a
OL,7,Fdecision on whether to proceed with an
OL,8,Fe-scooter trial had not yet been made,
OL,9,Fand was conditional on backing from
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police and other
OL,11,Fgroups.
